# 4. 確定した利用者向け境界

```text
show-proof != execute

query
= existing fact lookup
!= evaluator

query-proof
= selected fact replay
!= enclosing theorem replay

candidate number
!= theorem ranking

fact number
!= theorem ranking

--depth
= replay visibility bound
!= new proof search

deduplicated presentation
!= provenance deletion

safe type-name fallback
!= inferred mathematical explanation
```

